    "provenance": "Original controlled failures and early passes used ef41b8c with the earlier Apple-style theme. The passing seven-method restored-design run used 5ae87e8 plus this correction. Only OverviewView changed when advancing to 1b968ab; the 11/16-method runs and archive use the final manifest. The separately installed b17a6a2 phone build excluded this correction."
  },
  "findings": [
    "An owner pause/removal could skip its confirmation read while an earlier refresh was pending, then display the old state.",
    "A recipient could see a declined request or obsolete error return from an older response.",
    "A failed post-decline confirmation could leave unreadable connection feedback below the visible request with no revealed recovery action."
  ],
  "correction": "Read revisions reject obsolete success/error results; owner mutations invalidate older reads and fence account/participant changes. Recipient confirmation failures reveal readable status feedback, request accessibility focus and offer a fresh status read without repeating the mutation.",
  "fixtureSafety": "DEBUG and simulator only, nil backend for outer and inner models, synthetic identity and transport, no provider/network/notification requests. Test controls reserve separate layout space and retain normal text size while the production view uses the requested size.",
