  "toolingCorrections": [
    "The initial Xcode 27.1/CoreSimulator version mismatch exited 70 with zero tests; the owner completed local component authorization.",
    "The first resumed attempt used an intentionally held native refresh animation, preventing XCTest interaction. That exact owned test process was stopped (exit 143); it is not a completed baseline. The direct test button invokes the same production load method without the held animation.",
    "The complete controlled baseline naturally failed all five tests. Optional simctl diagnostics delayed result finalization; later runs disabled optional diagnostics. The diagnostic child exited naturally before a proposed targeted stop; no signal was sent to that child.",
    "Initial summary export attempts encountered an unfinished bundle and then local reporting-cache permissions; the complete result was subsequently exported successfully.",
    "A source-manifest attempt against the old asset inventory failed after the concurrent restoration. A new tracked-plus-owned-file manifest recorded the restored design before the successful result was accepted.",
    "An attachment export mistakenly selected failures only and returned no passing captures. Re-export into that directory refused to overwrite its manifest. A fresh directory with the PNG filter exported all captures; tests and source were unchanged."
  ],
